{"op": "append", "content": "[\u2705] [2026-01-20 05:54:45 UTC] [Agent: ArchitectAgent] [Project: agent_param_audit] ARCHITECTURE COMPLETE - Agent Parameter Standardization Design. Successfully designed implementation plan for adding required agent: str parameter to all 16 MCP tools. Key decision: Add agent parameter to diagnostic tools (health_check, scribe_doctor) for universal consistency rather than creating server.py exception list. All tools will have agent positioned after primary identifier (name/path/action) or as first parameter if no primary ID exists. Implementation organized into 5 scoped task packages across 3 phases (pre-flight, implementation, validation) with 59 verification checkpoints. Estimated duration: 5-8 hours over 1-2 days. All architecture documents complete and ready for Coder Agent. | categories={\"add_parameter\": 9, \"diagnostic_tools\": 2, \"optional_to_required\": 4, \"rename_parameter\": 1}; confidence=0.95; deliverables={\"estimated_duration_hours\": \"5-8\", \"phases\": 3, \"task_packages\": 5, \"verification_checkpoints\": 59}; documents_created=[\"ARCHITECTURE_GUIDE.md\", \"PHASE_PLAN.md\", \"CHECKLIST.md\"]; key_decisions={\"backward_compatibility\": \"server.py already enforces REQUIRED so no external breaking changes\", \"diagnostic_tools\": \"add_agent_param (not exception list)\", \"implementation_strategy\": \"single atomic phase with incremental validation\", \"parameter_positioning\": \"after primary identifier or first if no primary ID\"}; milestone=architecture_complete; reasoning={\"how\": \"Verified existing code patterns, analyzed server.py enforcement, designed phased implementation with 5 small task packages to enable incremental validation, created 59 verification checkpoints mapped to Review Agent grading criteria\", \"what\": \"Designed systematic approach updating tools in 4 categories with specific parameter positioning rules, incremental verification, and comprehensive quality gates\", \"why\": \"Server.py enforces agent parameter universally - need to make all 16 tools compliant to prevent ValueError failures\"}; tools_affected=16; priority=medium; log_type=progress; content_type=log\n", "file_path": "/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/.scribe/docs/dev_plans/agent_param_audit/PROGRESS_LOG.md", "id": "2026-01-20T05:54:45.194697+00:00_291278ae", "timestamp": "2026-01-20T05:54:45.194738+00:00"}
