{"op": "append", "content": "[\u274c] [2026-01-20 12:12:19 UTC] [Agent: CoderAgent] [Project: agent_param_audit] BLOCKED: Task Package 1 contains syntax contradiction - cannot make agent parameter required while keeping it after optional parameters (message, status, emoji all have defaults). Python requires all required params before optional params. | blocker=syntax_error; file=tools/append_entry.py; issue=non-default argument follows default argument; options=[\"Move agent to first position\", \"Keep agent in current position with marker value like Required sentinel\", \"Redesign parameter order\"]; reasoning={\"how\": \"Attempted direct change per task package, hit SyntaxError, need architectural clarification\", \"what\": \"Cannot have required parameter (agent: str) after optional parameters with defaults\", \"why\": \"Task package conflicts with Python syntax rules\"}; priority=high; log_type=progress; content_type=log\n", "file_path": "/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/.scribe/docs/dev_plans/agent_param_audit/PROGRESS_LOG.md", "id": "2026-01-20T12:12:19.083894+00:00_d9226d2f", "timestamp": "2026-01-20T12:12:19.083936+00:00"}
