{"op": "append", "content": "[\u26a0\ufe0f] [2026-01-20 12:12:36 UTC] [Agent: CoderAgent] [Project: agent_param_audit] Reverted append_entry.py to original state. Task Package 1 requires architectural decision: Either (1) Move agent parameter to first position before all optional params, OR (2) Use sentinel/validation approach to enforce at runtime while keeping current signature. Cannot implement \"make required + keep same position\" due to Python syntax constraints. | action=reverted_change; file=tools/append_entry.py; reasoning={\"how\": \"Used Edit tool to restore original signature, verified file is syntactically valid\", \"what\": \"Reverted agent parameter to Optional[str]=None signature\", \"why\": \"Preserve working codebase while awaiting architectural decision\"}; requires_clarification=True; suggested_solutions=[\"Move agent: str to first parameter position\", \"Keep Optional[str]=None but add runtime validation that raises if None\", \"Use sentinel value like REQUIRED and validate\"]; priority=medium; log_type=progress; content_type=log\n", "file_path": "/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/.scribe/docs/dev_plans/agent_param_audit/PROGRESS_LOG.md", "id": "2026-01-20T12:12:36.846119+00:00_a0524efb", "timestamp": "2026-01-20T12:12:36.846162+00:00"}
